e_admin":false},"body":"This pull-request fixes https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/101979\r\n\r\nIt transforms resources in arrays to resource paths before sending them through the debugger.\r\nAt the game instance the resources are then loaded again by using the resource path. \r\n\r\nThis is how Godot currently handles updating single resources in the inspector.\r\n\r\nthe typed_builtin, typed_class_name and typed_script have to be sent or else exposed arrays of custom-GDScript-resource-sub-types will not update correctly.\r\n\r\nres_indexes_array is there so that the solution also works with arrays of Variant/Object, since those can contain Resources too.\r\nArrays of Variant/Object also have the same bug with resources not being updated correctly.\r\n","labels":[{"id":73330064,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2NA==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/bug","name":"bug","description":"","color":"ff6055","default":true,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279098219,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTgyMTk=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:editor","name":"topic:editor","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"milestone":{"id":8237783,"node_id":"MI_kwDOAO6SJc4AfbLX","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/16","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/milestone/16","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/16/labels","number":16,"state":"open","title":"4.x","description":"Issues and pull requests slated for an undetermined Godot 4 release.","creator":{"login":"akien-mga","id":4701338,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ3MDEzMzg=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4701338?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga","html_url":"https://github.com/akien-mga","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com